To permanently delete or purge a soft-deleted Azure Key Vault or vault object, you need the Key Vault Purge Operator role or an Azure Subscription Owner
Neither standard Key Vault Contributor nor Key Vault Administrator roles can directly purge a soft-deleted vault or object unless they also hold the Purge Operator privilege or Subscription Owner rights
